<title>USA: U.S. Sept S&amp;P 500 futures sharply lower late day.</title>
<headline>U.S. Sept S&amp;P 500 futures sharply lower late day.</headline>
<text>
<p>July 9 - Most U.S. stock index futures were sharply lower late in the day. Sept S&amp;P 500 touched down the initial 15-point daily limit, then was lifted slightly from the day's low by buying from a dealer and locals, traders said. Nasdaq 100 still positive, though off highs.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk (312) 408-8750))</p>
